        "source_excerpt": "Publishing consistently across four distinct social platforms is one of the highest leverage growth motions for modern media teams.\nHowever, attemptin...",
        "source_derived_text": "Publishing consistently across four distinct social platforms is one of the highest leverage growth motions for modern media teams. However, attempting to record net-new footage and draft bespoke copy every single morning leads directly to creator exhaustion and erratic distribution. A disciplined repurposing architecture converts one foundational masterclass into platform-native short videos, visual carousels, and discussion threads.",
